        "heading": "Overview",
        "body": "# Shuten Doji at Mount Oe: back crystal, enrage break, gourd denial\n\nShuten Doji is the “Gourd Drainer” boss at Mount Oe, fought during the story mission “The Demon on the Mount.” His HP bar in the UI is literally titled “Shuten Doji - Gourd Drainer.” Defeating him unlocks Oni Awakening, so the fight is also the gateway to every Phase-3 mechanic in the late game. Treat it as two fights in one: a posture-management fight to break the back crystal, and an animation-management fight to deny the gourd self-heal."
