        "heading": "Overview",
        "body": "# Onimusha Way of the Sword Platform Performance: PS5, Xbox, PC, Switch 2\n\nOnimusha Way of the Sword runs at different performance targets on each platform. PS5 and Xbox Series X target 4K / 60 in “Prioritize Performance” mode, Xbox Series S holds 1080p / 60, Steam leans on NVIDIA DLSS 4.5 and AMD FSR 3.1 upscaling to hit its PC minimum and recommended specs, and Nintendo Switch 2 is locked at 30 FPS in both TV (docked) and handheld modes at 1080p and 900p respectively. The only ray-traced reflections toggle in the game lives on PS5 Pro; the base PS5 has no in-game ray tracing toggle."
