    "h1": "Onimusha Way of the Sword review scores: Famitsu 34/40, IGN 10/10, OpenCritic 95% recommend",
    "seoTitle": "Onimusha Way of the Sword review scores: Famitsu 34/40, IGN 10/10, OpenCritic 95% recommend",
    "metaDescription": "Famitsu 34/40 (9/9/8/8), IGN 10/10, GameSpot 8/10, Metacritic 85-86 on PS5 with a 95% OpenCritic recommendation and Mighty tier — plus the consensus combat-first pros and cutscene-heavy cons.",
